        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By offering a variety of services and encouraging the active participation of each resident and such resident’s family and medical professionals, we are able to customize our service plan to meet the specific needs and desires of each resident.",
