        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following the CHP Merger, we will continue to provide services across the continuum of care, focused on up-market and mid-market, clustered around key regional markets with strong underlying growth fundamentals.",
