        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also foster the wellness of our residents by offering access to third-party provider health screenings (such as blood pressure checks), periodic special services (such as influenza and other inoculations), dietary and similar programs, and ongoing exercise and fitness classes.",
