        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are not aware, as of the date of this Annual Report on Form 10-K, of any environmental liability with respect to any of our owned or managed communities that we believe would have a material adverse effect on our business, financial condition, or results of operations.",
