        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the structure and composition of government and, specifically, health care regulations will continue to change and, as a result, we regularly monitor material developments and changes in the law that impact our business.",
