        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that, as one of the nation’s leading owners, operators, and investors in senior housing communities, we have the scale and resources needed to provide the required comprehensive range of senior living services designed to permit our residents to “age in place” within our communities as residents develop further physical or cognitive frailties, whereas smaller providers do not.",
